Write-Host "                  - Spawned alongside status reporter + rules watchdog"
Write-Host "    Effect: Golden Path complete: Sensor → createEvent → submitEvent →"
Write-Host "            PriorityQueue → popEvent → ForensicLog (then existing AC → Policy → PEP)"

Write-Host ""
